            "review_text": "Rayill\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nNot happy with the staff.\nMar 2026 • Solo\nI had a bad experience at the restaurant today. I called a portion of bullshit, bullshit and blood, but because I didn't eat bullshit, I asked to exchange for more beef or blood.\nWhat made me unhappy was that earlier when I bought it, I was advised by the staff that if I didn’t eat beef, the restaurant could make up for about 25g of beef. However, this time when I mention again, the staff did not agree to such support, despite the same thing and the same request.\nThe lack of consistency in the way of serving makes me feel incomprehensible and uncomfortable. If the restaurant has a clear policy, it should be applied uniformly, avoiding the case that customers receive different information between visits.\nHopefully the restaurant can review the service process and train staff to bring a better and more consistent experience to customers.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 30, 2026",
